"ref-4\" data-note=\"e79ea45002ccf795\" href=\"?note=e79ea45002ccf795\" title=\"43-df-condplainkolm\">43-df-condplainkolm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"aa33e0ea8422ba2a\" href=\"?note=aa33e0ea8422ba2a\" title=\"43-df-effective-coding\">43-df-effective-coding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Section 19.4.1; Section 19.4.2 before Theorem 19.4.10; Section 19.4.3"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"573,578,582"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"593,598,602"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,K,C(\\cdot\\mid\\cdot),K(\\cdot\\mid\\cdot)\">\\(C,K,C(\\cdot\\mid\\cdot),K(\\cdot\\mid\\cdot)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a0589ee7a1cc12e8\" href=\"?note=a0589ee7a1cc12e8\" title=\"43-df-kolm\">43-df-kolm</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"6cd902d852c2c848\" href=\"?note=6cd902d852c2c848\" title=\"43-df-prefixkolm\">43-df-prefixkolm</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e79ea45002ccf795\" href=\"?note=e79ea45002ccf795\" title=\"43-df-condplainkolm\">43-df-condplainkolm</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"1d74032e32e804fb\" href=\"?note=1d74032e32e804fb\" title=\"43-df-condkolm\">43-df-condkolm</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\rightharpoonup2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(V:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\rightharpoonup2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 为前缀自由机器，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_V\">\\(K_V\\)</span> 采用 prefixkolm 的机器相对版本。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 量化于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{C(\\cdot\\mid\\cdot),K(\\cdot\\mid\\cdot)\\}\">\\(\\{C(\\cdot\\mid\\cdot),K(\\cdot\\mid\\cdot)\\}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\#_2\">\\(\\#_2\\)</span> 与自然数配对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle\">\\(\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"aa33e0ea8422ba2a\" href=\"?note=aa33e0ea8422ba2a\" title=\"43-df-effective-coding\">43-df-effective-coding</a>；上图以下均编码成自然数集合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"R_C\\coloneqq\\{\\#_2(\\sigma):\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\land C(\\sigma)&lt;|\\sigma|\\},\\qquad R_K\\coloneqq\\{\\#_2(\\sigma):\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\land K(\\sigma)&lt;|\\sigma|\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[R_C\\coloneqq\\{\\#_2(\\sigma):\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\land C(\\sigma)&lt;|\\sigma|\\},\\qquad R_K\\coloneqq\\{\\#_2(\\sigma):\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\land K(\\sigma)&lt;|\\sigma|\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M_C\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\#_2(\\sigma),n\\rangle:\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\land n\\in\\mathbb N\\land C(\\sigma)&lt;n\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M_C\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\#_2(\\sigma),n\\rangle:\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\land n\\in\\mathbb N\\land C(\\sigma)&lt;n\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M_{K_V}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\#_2(\\sigma),n\\rangle:\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\land n\\in\\mathbb N\\land K_V(\\sigma)&lt;n\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M_{K_V}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\#_2(\\sigma),n\\rangle:\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\land n\\in\\mathbb N\\land K_V(\\sigma)&lt;n\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"N_Q\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\#_2(\\sigma),\\langle\\#_2(\\tau),n\\rangle\\rangle:\\sigma,\\tau\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\land n\\in\\mathbb N\\land Q(\\sigma\\mid\\tau)&lt;n\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[N_Q\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\#_2(\\sigma),\\langle\\#_2(\\tau),n\\rangle\\rangle:\\sigma,\\tau\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\land n\\in\\mathbb N\\land Q(\\sigma\\mid\\tau)&lt;n\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这里的“上图”沿用原书术语，指复杂度严格小于阈值的集合。用自然数编码后归约关系类型闭合。弱前缀非随机串 RK 是 c.e.，而强条件 K(σ)&lt;|σ|+K(|σ|)−c 涉及两个下降近似的比较，不能据此认定为 c.e.；后者未混入此定义。</p>\n<p>来源：所供 2007-07-28 草稿，Section 19.4.1; Section 19.4.2 before Theorem 19.4.10; Section 19.4.3，印刷页 573,578,582，PDF 页 593,598,602。本轮逐项核对陈述；未把来源完整证明或机器形式化标为已核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-kolm","status":"resolved","id":"a0589ee7a1cc12e8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-kolm]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-prefixkolm","status":"resolved","id":"6cd902d852c2c848","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-prefixkolm]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-condkolm","status":"resolved","id":"1d74032e32e804fb","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-condkolm]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-condplainkolm","status":"resolved","id":"e79ea45002ccf795","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-condplainkolm]]","embed":false},{"target":"4